WEBVTT

NOTE
Audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2
File: disc02_20h.avi
Scene: The Ragnarok in flight - scenic sequence toward the Lunatic Pandora
Duration: approximately 19 seconds
Describes a moment of peace and connection between Squall and Rinoa during their flight across the world.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The Ragnarok's cockpit windows frame an expansive view. Below, a sprawling blue ocean stretches endlessly, dotted with green islands rising from the depths.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Squall sits in the pilot's seat, his hands steady on the controls. Rinoa stands beside him, her hand resting on his shoulder. Her recovery is evident in her upright posture and calm expression.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
They fly over islands and cloud formations. The sky is clear and bright. This moment is theirs — a brief respite before the final confrontation.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Rinoa looks out toward the horizon with quiet determination. She knows what she is now. A Sorceress. But Squall stands beside her without hesitation. Together, they are unstoppable.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
The Ragnarok continues its journey. Ahead lies the Lunatic Pandora and the final battle. But for now, there is peace. There is each other. That will have to be enough.